WEBVTT

00:02:56.996 --> 00:03:01.116
And it took me three years
because I felt such responsibility

00:03:01.116 --> 00:03:04.156
as one of the only women of color
sitting at the seat.

00:03:04.196 --> 00:03:08.196
I felt not only responsible to myself,
but to the women of color around me.

00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:10.756
And I wanted to make sure that my leaving

00:03:10.796 --> 00:03:12.476
and my quitting and my exiting

00:03:12.516 --> 00:03:16.636
wouldn't reflect badly on my own
performance and my own capabilities,

00:03:16.676 --> 00:03:19.276
but wouldn't reflect badly
on others who came after me,

00:03:19.276 --> 00:03:21.796
that people wouldn't say,
"Oh, she couldn't hack it."

00:03:21.796 --> 00:03:25.196
And so I really sat in wanting to leave
and not being able to.

00:03:25.236 --> 00:03:28.356
And so what I started to do is
I started to gather women of color.

00:03:28.356 --> 00:03:29.756
Initially started one-on-one.

00:03:29.756 --> 00:03:32.996
And I wanted to figure out
where does someone at a senior level go.